  "scope": [
    "Mandatory typed publication slots resolve through declared authored references. Runtime and preparation verify target/code/binding agreement.",
    "One Direct registration per reference covers authored/published inputs; original and staged routes discover the closure before evaluation.",
    "Final publication edges share the existing financial graph; projection reads ready current workspace records, never cached Plan-derived values.",
